              INTO PERSALANI SEPARATED BY SPACE.
ENDIF.
*** 'Personel alt alanı :' ***
IF PNPBTRTL-LOW IS INITIAL.
ELSEIF PNPBTRTL-HIGH IS INITIAL.
  IF PNPBTRTL-OPTION EQ 'EQ'.
    CONCATENATE PALTALANI PNPBTRTL-LOW
                INTO PALTALANI SEPARATED BY SPACE.
  ELSEIF PNPBTRTL-OPTION EQ 'NE'.
    CONCATENATE PALTALANI PNPBTRTL-LOW '-HARİCİ-'
