*** 'Çalışan grubu :' ***
IF PNPPERSG-LOW IS INITIAL.
ELSEIF PNPPERSG-HIGH IS INITIAL.
  IF PNPPERSG-OPTION EQ 'EQ'.
    CONCATENATE CALGRUBU PNPPERSG-LOW
                INTO CALGRUBU SEPARATED BY SPACE.
  ELSEIF PNPPERSG-OPTION EQ 'NE'.
    CONCATENATE CALGRUBU PNPPERSG-LOW '-HARİCİ-'
                INTO CALGRUBU SEPARATED BY SPACE.
  ELSE.
    CONCATENATE CALGRUBU '(' PNPPERSG-OPTION ')' PNPPERSG-LOW
                INTO CALGRUBU SEPARATED BY SPACE.
  ENDIF.
ELSE.
  CONCATENATE CALGRUBU PNPPERSG-LOW '-' PNPPERSG-HIGH
              INTO CALGRUBU SEPARATED BY SPACE.
ENDIF.
*** 'Çalışan alt grubu :' ***
IF PNPPERSK-LOW IS INITIAL.
