*** 'Bordro alt birimi :' ***
IF PNPABKRS-LOW IS INITIAL.
ELSEIF PNPABKRS-HIGH IS INITIAL.
  IF PNPABKRS-OPTION EQ 'EQ'.
    CONCATENATE BDRALTBIRIMI PNPABKRS-LOW
                INTO BDRALTBIRIMI SEPARATED BY SPACE.
  ELSEIF PNPABKRS-OPTION EQ 'NE'.
    CONCATENATE BDRALTBIRIMI PNPABKRS-LOW '-HARİCİ-'
                INTO BDRALTBIRIMI SEPARATED BY SPACE.
  ELSE.
    CONCATENATE BDRALTBIRIMI '(' PNPABKRS-OPTION ')' PNPABKRS-LOW
                INTO BDRALTBIRIMI SEPARATED BY SPACE.
