*** 'Üst alan (Şef alanı) :' ***
IF PNPMSTBR-LOW IS INITIAL.
ELSEIF PNPMSTBR-HIGH IS INITIAL.
  IF PNPMSTBR-OPTION EQ 'EQ'.
    CONCATENATE USTALAN PNPMSTBR-LOW
                INTO USTALAN SEPARATED BY SPACE.
  ELSEIF PNPMSTBR-OPTION EQ 'NE'.
    CONCATENATE USTALAN PNPMSTBR-LOW '-HARİCİ-'
                INTO USTALAN SEPARATED BY SPACE.
  ELSE.
